"在全部十二个引擎就绪后（四个 Prefill 和八个 Decode），按照\n"
"    [Prefill-Decode 分离（DeepSeek）](../features/pd_disaggregation_mooncake_multi_node.md)\n"
"    中的说明部署代理。\n"
"    为代理配置 Prefill 端点 `<PREFILL_NODE_1_IP>:7100` 和\n"
"    `<PREFILL_NODE_1_IP>:7101`、`<PREFILL_NODE_2_IP>:7100` 和\n"
"    `<PREFILL_NODE_2_IP>:7101`，以及 Decode 端点\n"
"    `<DECODE_NODE_1_IP>:7100` 到 `<DECODE_NODE_1_IP>:7103`、\n"
"    `<DECODE_NODE_2_IP>:7100` 到 `<DECODE_NODE_2_IP>:7103`。例如，\n"
"    在第一台 Prefill 节点上运行负载均衡代理："

msgid "#### 5.2.2.5 Key Parameter Descriptions"
msgstr "#### 5.2.2.5 关键参数说明"

msgid ""
"- The A2 layout is 1P1D: the Prefill role spans two servers (DP4/TP4\n"
"      ranks each) and the Decode role spans two servers (DP8/TP2 ranks\n"
"      each). On every A2 server the local DP ranks multiplied by TP must\n"
"      consume all 8 devices: 2 × 4 on each Prefill server and 4 × 2 on each\n"
"      Decode server.\n"
"    - `VLLM_ENGINE_READY_TIMEOUT_S=360000` gives every Prefill and Decode\n"
"      engine up to 100 hours to finish startup. Weights are loaded from shared\n"
"      storage, which is slower on A2; this validated value is intentionally\n"
"      larger than the A3 value.\n"
"    - Both roles use `--engram-config '{\"cpu_offload\":true,\"dp_shared_memory\":true}'`.\n"
"      The Engram table is kept in host memory and shared by the local DP\n"
"      ranks of each server. With TP4 and TP2 the model's 24 Engram heads are\n"
"      divided evenly (6 and 12 heads per rank), but the host-memory table must\n"
"      still be shared across the node's local DP ranks, which requires the\n"
"      container to run with `--ipc=host` or a `/dev/shm` of at least 320g.\n"
"    - Prefix caching is enabled only on Prefill. Decode disables it and\n"
"      enables `recompute_scheduler_enable` so requests can be recomputed when\n"
"      the Prefill-side KV cache is unavailable.\n"
"    - Prefill and Decode use the same --additional-config options as A3.\n"
"    - `HCCL_IF_IP` and the socket interface variables must select the same\n"
"      high-speed service network used by the configured node IPs.\n"
"      `HCCL_INTRA_ROCE_ENABLE=1` enables RoCE transport for intra-node HCCL\n"
"      on A2. `HCCL_BUFFSIZE` is `1024` on Prefill and `1800` on Decode;\n"
"      retain these role-specific values unless another setting has been\n"
"      validated. `HCCL_OP_EXPANSION_MODE=\"AIV\"` is set on Prefill only.\n"
"    Wait until every engine finishes loading weights and Decode finishes graph\n"
"    capture. A successful startup includes output similar to:"
msgstr ""
"- A2 布局为 1P1D：Prefill 角色跨两台服务器（每台 DP4/TP4\n"
"      卡），Decode 角色跨两台服务器（每台 DP8/TP2 卡）。在每台 A2 服务器上，本地 DP 卡数乘以 TP 必须\n"
"      占满全部 8 个设备：每台 Prefill 服务器为 2 × 4，每台\n"
"      Decode 服务器为 4 × 2。\n"
"    - `VLLM_ENGINE_READY_TIMEOUT_S=360000` 为每个 Prefill 和 Decode\n"
"      引擎提供最多 100 小时完成启动。权重从共享\n"
"      存储加载，在 A2 上较慢；此经验证的值有意\n"
"      大于 A3 的值。\n"
"    - 两个角色均使用 `--engram-config '{\"cpu_offload\":true,\"dp_shared_memory\":true}'`。\n"
"      Engram 表保存在主机内存中，并由每台服务器的本地 DP\n"
"      卡共享。在 TP4 和 TP2 下，模型的 24 个 Engram 头\n"
"      被均匀划分（每卡 6 和 12 个头），但主机内存表仍必须\n"
"      在节点的本地 DP 卡之间共享，这要求\n"
"      容器以 `--ipc=host` 运行，或使用至少 320g 的 `/dev/shm`。\n"
"    - 前缀缓存仅在 Prefill 上启用。Decode 禁用该功能并\n"
"      启用 `recompute_scheduler_enable`，以便在\n"
"      Prefill 侧 KV 缓存不可用时重新计算请求。\n"
"    - Prefill 和 Decode 使用与 A3 相同的 --additional-config 选项。\n"
"    - `HCCL_IF_IP` 和套接字接口变量必须选择与所配置节点 IP\n"
"      相同的高速服务网络。\n"
"      `HCCL_INTRA_ROCE_ENABLE=1` 在 A2 上为节点内 HCCL 启用 RoCE 传输。\n"
"      `HCCL_BUFFSIZE` 在 Prefill 上为 `1024`，在 Decode 上为 `1800`；\n"
"      除非已验证其他设置，否则请保留这些角色特定的值。\n"
"      `HCCL_OP_EXPANSION_MODE=\"AIV\"` 仅在 Prefill 上设置。\n"
"    等待每个引擎完成权重加载，且 Decode 完成图\n"
"    捕获。成功启动包含类似如下输出："

msgid ""
"Reuse `launch_online_dp.py` from Section 5.2.1.1. Set `MEMCACHE_INSTALL_PATH` to\n"
"the `Location` reported by `pip show memcache_hybrid`, and set\n"
"`MEMCACHE_CONFIG_DIR` to the absolute directory containing the configuration\n"
"files above on both nodes."
msgstr ""
"复用 5.2.1.1 节中的 `launch_online_dp.py`。将 `MEMCACHE_INSTALL_PATH` 设置为\n"
"`pip show memcache_hybrid` 报告的 `Location`，并将\n"
"`MEMCACHE_CONFIG_DIR` 设置为两个节点上包含上述配置\n"
"文件的绝对目录。"

msgid ""
"Start the four DP4/TP4 Prefill engines with the launcher command from "
"Section 5.2.2.1 after all Decode engines are ready."
msgstr "在所有 Decode 引擎就绪后，使用 5.2.2.1 节中的启动器命令启动四个 DP4/TP4 Prefill 引擎。"

msgid ""
"Wait until both standalone Memcache processes report successful initialization\n"
"before starting the Decode engines. Then wait until every Decode engine reports\n"
"`Application startup complete` before starting Prefill. After every Prefill engine is ready, start the proxy with the\n"
"same endpoint mapping described in Section 5.2.1.4."
msgstr ""
"等待两个独立 Memcache 进程均报告初始化成功\n"
"后再启动 Decode 引擎。然后等待每个 Decode 引擎报告\n"
"`Application startup complete` 后再启动 Prefill。在每个 Prefill 引擎就绪后，使用\n"
"5.2.1.4 节中描述的相同端点映射启动代理。"

msgid "### 5.4 1P1D Deployment with Mooncake KV Cache Pool"
msgstr "### 5.4 使用 Mooncake KV Cache Pool 的 1P1D 部署"

msgid ""
"This configuration extends the A2 1P1D deployment in Section 5.2 with a\n"
"Mooncake KV Cache Pool. `MooncakeHybridConnector` continues to transfer KV\n"
"cache from Prefill to Decode, while `AscendStoreConnector` stores reusable KV\n"
"cache in Mooncake. Both connectors are configured as children of\n"
"`MultiConnector`."
msgstr ""
"此配置在 5.2 节的 A2 1P1D 部署基础上增加了\n"
"Mooncake KV Cache Pool。`MooncakeHybridConnector` 继续将 KV\n"
"缓存从 Prefill 传输到 Decode，而 `AscendStoreConnector` 将可复用的 KV\n"
"缓存存储到 Mooncake 中。两个连接器均配置为\n"
"`MultiConnector` 的子连接器。"

msgid ""
"Before starting vLLM, configure `mooncake.json`, and start the\n"
"mooncake_master Service. The Prefill and Decode nodes must export `MOONCAKE_CONFIG_PATH` ."
msgstr ""
"在启动 vLLM 之前，配置 `mooncake.json`，并启动\n"
"mooncake_master 服务。Prefill 和 Decode 节点必须导出 `MOONCAKE_CONFIG_PATH`。"

msgid "#### 5.4.1 Prepare the Mooncake Services"
msgstr "#### 5.4.1 准备 Mooncake 服务"

msgid "Configure `mooncake.json`:"
msgstr "配置 `mooncake.json`："

msgid "Start mooncake_master:"
msgstr "启动 mooncake_master："

msgid ""
"After `mooncake.json` is ready, start the mooncake_master process on one "
"node and wait for successful initialization:"
msgstr "`mooncake.json` 就绪后，在一个节点上启动 mooncake_master 进程并等待初始化成功："

msgid ""
"eviction_high_watermark_ratio determines the watermark where Mooncake Store will perform eviction.\n"
"eviction_ratio determines the portion of stored objects that would be evicted.\n"
"default_kv_lease_ttl controls the default lease TTL for KV objects (milliseconds).\n"
"configure it via --default_kv_lease_ttl and keep it larger than ASCEND_CONNECT_TIMEOUT and ASCEND_TRANSFER_TIMEOUT."
msgstr ""
"eviction_high_watermark_ratio 决定 Mooncake Store 执行驱逐的水位线。\n"
"eviction_ratio 决定将被驱逐的已存储对象的比例。\n"
"default_kv_lease_ttl 控制 KV 对象的默认租约 TTL（毫秒）。\n"
"通过 --default_kv_lease_ttl 配置它，并保持其大于 ASCEND_CONNECT_TIMEOUT 和 ASCEND_TRANSFER_TIMEOUT。"

msgid "#### 5.4.2 Start the Prefill Node with Pooling"
msgstr "#### 5.4.2 启动带 Pooling 的 Prefill 节点"

msgid ""
"On the Prefill node, save the following script as `run_dp_template.sh`. Set\n"
"`LOCAL_IP`, `NIC_NAME`, `MODEL_PATH`, and\n"
"`MOONCAKE_CONFIG_DIR` for the local environment."
msgstr ""
"在 Prefill 节点上，将以下脚本保存为 `run_dp_template.sh`。根据\n"
"本地环境设置 `LOCAL_IP`、`NIC_NAME`、`MODEL_PATH` 和\n"
"`MOONCAKE_CONFIG_DIR`。"

msgid "#### 5.4.3 Start the Decode Node with Pooling"
msgstr "#### 5.4.3 启动带 Pooling 的 Decode 节点"

msgid ""
"On the Decode node, save the following script as `run_dp_template.sh`. Set\n"
"`LOCAL_IP`, `NIC_NAME`, `MODEL_PATH`, and\n"
"`MOONCAKE_CONFIG_DIR` for the local environment."
msgstr ""
"在 Decode 节点上，将以下脚本保存为 `run_dp_template.sh`。根据\n"
"本地环境设置 `LOCAL_IP`、`NIC_NAME`、`MODEL_PATH` 和\n"
"`MOONCAKE_CONFIG_DIR`。"

msgid ""
"Start the eight DP8/TP2 Decode engines with the launcher command from "
"Section 5.2.2.1."
msgstr "使用 5.2.2.1 节中的启动器命令启动八个 DP8/TP2 Decode 引擎。"

msgid "#### 5.4.4 Startup and Verification"
msgstr "#### 5.4.4 启动与验证"

msgid ""
"Start the components in this order: Mooncake Master Service, standalone Mooncake Store on both Prefill and Decode nodes, Decode engines, Prefill engines, and then the PD proxy.\n"
"Wait until the Mooncake master process reports successful initialization before starting the Decode engines and the Prefill engines. After every Prefill engine and every Decode engine is ready, start the proxy with the same endpoint mapping described in Section 5.2.2.4."
msgstr ""
"按以下顺序启动各组件：Mooncake Master 服务、Prefill 和 Decode 节点上的独立 Mooncake Store、Decode 引擎、Prefill 引擎，最后是 PD 代理。\n"
"等待 Mooncake master 进程报告初始化成功后再启动 Decode 引擎和 Prefill 引擎。在每个 Prefill 引擎和每个 Decode 引擎就绪后，使用 5.2.2.4 节中描述的相同端点映射启动代理。"

msgid ""
"Send the same request twice with a reusable prefix. Confirm that Prefill "
"logs show Mooncake lookup, get, put, and hit activity, and that Decode logs "
"still show normal Prefill-to-Decode KV transfer."
msgstr ""
"使用可复用的前缀发送两次相同的请求。确认 Prefill 日志显示 Mooncake 的查找、获取、写入和命中活动，并且 Decode 日志仍显示正常的"
" Prefill 到 Decode KV 传输。"

msgid ""
"- `MultiConnector` combines live P-to-D transfer through `MooncakeHybridConnector` with persistent prefix reuse through `AscendStoreConnector`.\n"
"- `backend: \"mooncake\"` selects Mooncake as the KV Cache Pool backend.\n"
"- `use_layerwise: false` is required for DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash. Do not enable layerwise pooling for this model because its CED hybrid-attention structure is not supported by the layerwise path."
msgstr ""
"- `MultiConnector` 将通过 `MooncakeHybridConnector` 进行的实时 P 到 D 传输与通过 `AscendStoreConnector` 进行的持久前缀复用相结合。\n"
"- `backend: \"mooncake\"` 选择 Mooncake 作为 KV Cache Pool 后端。\n"
"- DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash 需要 `use_layerwise: false`。请勿为此模型启用分层池化，因为其 CED 混合注意力结构不受分层路径支持。"

msgid "### 5.5 Multi-Node Colocated Deployment"
msgstr "### 5.5 多节点共置部署"

msgid "### 5.6 Service Verification"
msgstr "### 5.6 服务验证"
